<?xml version="1.0"?>
<?xml-model href="http://download.ros.org/schema/package_format3.xsd" schematypens="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"?>
<package format="3">
  <name>trnav_2ws_dock_ros</name>
  <version>0.1.0</version>
  <description>
    벽 3면 측위(/wall_pose) 기준 정밀 도킹 액션 서버. 이식 코어(trnav_2ws_dock_control,
    LGIT dock_control 무수정 이식)를 조립해 /motion/wheel_cmd/dock(mux source 40)으로 낸다.
    근거: docs/adr/2026-08-23-2ws-dock-ros-w3.md
  </description>
  <maintainer email="kukwonko@gmail.com">Big-AMR</maintainer>
  <license>Proprietary</license>

  <buildtool_depend>ament_cmake</buildtool_depend>

  <depend>rclcpp</depend>
  <depend>rclcpp_action</depend>
  <depend>geometry_msgs</depend>
  <depend>trnav_msgs</depend>
  <depend>trnav_2ws_interfaces</depend>

  <export>
    <build_type>ament_cmake</build_type>
  </export>
</package>
